window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b140-441b3714b1611d46.json"]={sha256:"441b3714b1611d463a294c76b9756ffba5e639202022c40009965570d7708f19",value:{"id":"b140","title":"隧道管片預鑄與養護","titleEn":"Tunnel-segment precasting and curing","category":"underground","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課聚焦把環片永久受力、製造品質與暫態施工荷載連成完整驗證鏈。沿著調查依據、物理作用、數量估算、現場驗證到工程交接逐項建立可追溯的推論鏈，特別辨別單一數值無法揭露的空間差異及時間效應。以獨立量測檢驗簡化模型，並把觀測結果、教學假設與需要主管工程師審查的決策清楚分列。","summaryEn":"This course focuses on connect permanent segment behavior, manufacturing quality and temporary construction loads. It develops a traceable reasoning chain from evidence and physical processes through quantitative estimates, field verification and engineering handover. Spatial variation and time effects are separated from a single nominal result. Independent observations test the simplified models, while measured evidence, teaching assumptions and decisions requiring the responsible engineer remain explicitly distinguished.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"ug-tbm","subcategoryTitle":"潛盾與掘進系統","subcategoryTitleEn":"Shield and tunnel-boring systems","learningTrack":"underground","learningSubdiscipline":"ug-tbm","learningTags":["underground","ug-tbm","tbm"],"architectureFamily":"tbm","architectureNodes":[["全環與局部荷載","Ring and local load cases"],["纖維與殘餘韌性","Fibres and residual toughness"],["早齡溫差與養護","Early-age temperature and curing"],["推進千斤頂局部承壓","Local jack bearing"],["環片序號與品質交接","Segment serials and quality handover"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[3,1]],"diagram":{"type":"tbm","labels":["全環與局部荷載","纖維與殘餘韌性","早齡溫差與養護","推進千斤頂局部承壓","環片序號與品質交接"],"labelsEn":["Ring and local load cases","Fibres and residual toughness","Early-age temperature and curing","Local jack bearing","Segment serials and quality handover"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創教學算例，所有輸入是為比較機制而假設，並非任何地標的實測資料。以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設薄環均勻外壓p=0.3 MPa、半徑3 m，環向膜力N=pR=0.9 MN/m；不含彎矩及接縫。以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設三個抗壓試值48、50、52 MPa，平均50 MPa；此小樣本平均不是規範特徵強度。將第一式的一個線性乘數加倍而固定其他邊界，該項貢獻隨之加倍；若為非線性式則必須重新代入，不能等比例外推。把輸入值、單位換算、計算結果及假設列成四欄，再用獨立計算器重算；最後比較量測誤差與模型簡化，判斷改變是否足以支持工程決策。","textEn":"Original teaching example: all inputs are assumptions for comparing mechanisms, not measurements from a landmark project. The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume uniform pressure p=0.3 MPa on a thin ring of radius 3 m; membrane force N=pR=0.9 MN/m, excluding bending and joints. The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assumed compressive results 48,50 and 52 MPa average 50 MPa; this small-sample mean is not a code-defined characteristic strength. Doubling one linear multiplicative input in the first relation while holding the remaining boundaries fixed doubles that contribution; a nonlinear relation must instead be evaluated again. Tabulate inputs, unit conversions, results and assumptions in separate columns, and recalculate independently. Finally compare measurement uncertainty with model simplification before deciding whether the difference supports an engineering decision.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":14,"enrichmentVersion":14,"stages":[{"id":"b140-v14-s1","title":"地層條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Ground conditions, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「全環與局部荷載」與「材料批次與強度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Ring and local load cases\" and \"Material batches and strength\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b140-v14-01","title":"全環與局部荷載：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Ring and local load cases: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「全環與局部荷載」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Ring and local load cases” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"預鑄環片完成閉環後承受土水載重，運輸、組裝與推進時卻有不同邊界和集中力。永久環分析不能包辦所有階段，需建立從工廠到受力成環的荷載路徑清單，逐項確認最不利狀態。 假設薄環均勻外壓p=0.3 MPa、半徑3 m，環向膜力N=pR=0.9 MN/m；不含彎矩及接縫。 環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「全環與局部荷載」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A closed segmental ring carries ground and water loads, while transport, assembly and thrust impose different restraints and concentrated forces. Permanent-ring analysis cannot cover every stage; trace load paths from factory to completed ring. Assume uniform pressure p=0.3 MPa on a thin ring of radius 3 m; membrane force N=pR=0.9 MN/m, excluding bending and joints. Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Ring and local load cases” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「全環與局部荷載」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Ring and local load cases”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-01-k1","title":"全環與局部荷載","titleEn":"Ring and local load cases","text":"預鑄環片完成閉環後承受土水載重，運輸、組裝與推進時卻有不同邊界和集中力。永久環分析不能包辦所有階段，需建立從工廠到受力成環的荷載路徑清單，逐項確認最不利狀態。","textEn":"A closed segmental ring carries ground and water loads, while transport, assembly and thrust impose different restraints and concentrated forces. Permanent-ring analysis cannot cover every stage; trace load paths from factory to completed ring.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「全環與局部荷載」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ring and local load cases\" is correct?","options":["永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。","預鑄環片完成閉環後承受土水載重，運輸、組裝與推進時卻有不同邊界和集中力。","少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。"],"optionsEn":["Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance.","A closed segmental ring carries ground and water loads, while transport, assembly and thrust impose different restraints and concentrated forces.","The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch."],"answer":1,"explanation":"預鑄環片完成閉環後承受土水載重，運輸、組裝與推進時卻有不同邊界和集中力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A closed segmental ring carries ground and water loads, while transport, assembly and thrust impose different restraints and concentrated forces. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b140-v14-02","title":"全環與局部荷載：定量估算","titleEn":"Ring and local load cases: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「全環與局部荷載」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Ring and local load cases” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設薄環均勻外壓p=0.3 MPa、半徑3 m，環向膜力N=pR=0.9 MN/m；不含彎矩及接縫。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume uniform pressure p=0.3 MPa on a thin ring of radius 3 m; membrane force N=pR=0.9 MN/m, excluding bending and joints. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設薄環均勻外壓p=0.3 MPa、半徑3 m，環向膜力N=pR=0.9 MN/m；不含彎矩及接縫。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume uniform pressure p=0.3 MPa on a thin ring of radius 3 m; membrane force N=pR=0.9 MN/m, excluding bending and joints.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「全環與局部荷載」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ring and local load cases\", which statement holds?","options":["同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。","同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square.","Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b140-v14-03","title":"全環與局部荷載：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Ring and local load cases: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「全環與局部荷載」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ring and local load cases” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄全環與局部荷載的資料來源與適用條件。將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for ring and local load cases. List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate.","failure":"注意干擾：環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。","textEn":"List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄全環與局部荷載的資料來源與適用條件。將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for ring and local load cases. List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「全環與局部荷載」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ring and local load cases\"?","options":["將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。"],"optionsEn":["List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b140-v14-04","title":"全環與局部荷載：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ring and local load cases: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「全環與局部荷載」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ring and local load cases” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。","textEn":"Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「全環與局部荷載」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ring and local load cases\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。","少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability.","The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch."],"answer":1,"explanation":"環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b140-v14-05","title":"材料批次與強度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Material batches and strength: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-04"],"objective":"說明「材料批次與強度」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Material batches and strength” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"混凝土強度受配料、含氣、養護和試體代表性影響，單一高強度試塊不代表整批均勻。環片還需控制韌性、密實與尺寸，強度數字只是品質鏈的一部分而非全部驗收證據。 假設三個抗壓試值48、50、52 MPa，平均50 MPa；此小樣本平均不是規範特徵強度。 試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「材料批次與強度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Concrete strength depends on batching, air, curing and specimen representativeness. One high result does not prove a uniform batch, and toughness, compaction and dimensions remain separate parts of segment quality. Assumed compressive results 48,50 and 52 MPa average 50 MPa; this small-sample mean is not a code-defined characteristic strength. Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Material batches and strength” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「材料批次與強度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Material batches and strength”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-05-k1","title":"材料批次與強度","titleEn":"Material batches and strength","text":"混凝土強度受配料、含氣、養護和試體代表性影響，單一高強度試塊不代表整批均勻。環片還需控制韌性、密實與尺寸，強度數字只是品質鏈的一部分而非全部驗收證據。","textEn":"Concrete strength depends on batching, air, curing and specimen representativeness. One high result does not prove a uniform batch, and toughness, compaction and dimensions remain separate parts of segment quality.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料批次與強度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Material batches and strength\" is correct?","options":["少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。","纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。","混凝土強度受配料、含氣、養護和試體代表性影響，單一高強度試塊不代表整批均勻。"],"optionsEn":["The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch.","Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.","Concrete strength depends on batching, air, curing and specimen representativeness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"混凝土強度受配料、含氣、養護和試體代表性影響，單一高強度試塊不代表整批均勻。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Concrete strength depends on batching, air, curing and specimen representativeness. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b140-v14-06","title":"材料批次與強度：定量估算","titleEn":"Material batches and strength: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「材料批次與強度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Material batches and strength” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設三個抗壓試值48、50、52 MPa，平均50 MPa；此小樣本平均不是規範特徵強度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assumed compressive results 48,50 and 52 MPa average 50 MPa; this small-sample mean is not a code-defined characteristic strength. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設三個抗壓試值48、50、52 MPa，平均50 MPa；此小樣本平均不是規範特徵強度。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assumed compressive results 48,50 and 52 MPa average 50 MPa; this small-sample mean is not a code-defined characteristic strength.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料批次與強度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Material batches and strength\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。","千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking.","Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b140-v14-07","title":"材料批次與強度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Material batches and strength: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「材料批次與強度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Material batches and strength” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄材料批次與強度的資料來源與適用條件。核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for material batches and strength. Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review.","failure":"注意干擾：試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。","textEn":"Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄材料批次與強度的資料來源與適用條件。核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for material batches and strength. Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料批次與強度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Material batches and strength\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。","完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time.","An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack."],"answer":1,"explanation":"核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b140-v14-08","title":"材料批次與強度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Material batches and strength: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「材料批次與強度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Material batches and strength” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。","textEn":"Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料批次與強度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Material batches and strength\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。","試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.","Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces."],"answer":2,"explanation":"試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b140-v14-s2","title":"機制、材料與定量設計","titleEn":"Mechanisms, materials and quantitative design","description":"本階段聚焦「纖維與殘餘韌性」與「模具與幾何公差」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Fibres and residual toughness\" and \"Moulds and geometric tolerances\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b140-v14-09","title":"纖維與殘餘韌性：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Fibres and residual toughness: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-08"],"objective":"說明「纖維與殘餘韌性」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fibres and residual toughness” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"纖維跨越裂縫後提供殘餘拉力，但效果取決於取向、分布與錨定，不能只由每立方米重量推定。鋼筋和纖維的角色需依設計分清，局部集中力與接縫區仍可能需要專門細節。 假設中央單點載重的三點彎曲缺口梁，殘餘荷重12 kN、跨距0.5 m、寬0.15 m、有效韌帶0.125 m，fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa。 澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「纖維與殘餘韌性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fibres bridge cracks with residual resistance governed by orientation, distribution and anchorage, not dosage alone. Their role relative to reinforcement must be designed, with concentrated loads and joint zones requiring specific detailing. Assume a notched beam under three-point centre loading with residual load 12 kN, span 0.5 m, width 0.15 m and ligament 0.125 m; fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa. Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Fibres and residual toughness” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「纖維與殘餘韌性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Fibres and residual toughness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-09-k1","title":"纖維與殘餘韌性","titleEn":"Fibres and residual toughness","text":"纖維跨越裂縫後提供殘餘拉力，但效果取決於取向、分布與錨定，不能只由每立方米重量推定。鋼筋和纖維的角色需依設計分清，局部集中力與接縫區仍可能需要專門細節。","textEn":"Fibres bridge cracks with residual resistance governed by orientation, distribution and anchorage, not dosage alone. Their role relative to reinforcement must be designed, with concentrated loads and joint zones requiring specific detailing.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「纖維與殘餘韌性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fibres and residual toughness\" is correct?","options":["纖維跨越裂縫後提供殘餘拉力，但效果取決於取向、分布與錨定，不能只由每立方米重量推定。","纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。","同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。"],"optionsEn":["Fibres bridge cracks with residual resistance governed by orientation, distribution and anchorage, not dosage alone.","Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.","Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square."],"answer":0,"explanation":"纖維跨越裂縫後提供殘餘拉力，但效果取決於取向、分布與錨定，不能只由每立方米重量推定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fibres bridge cracks with residual resistance governed by orientation, distribution and anchorage, not dosage alone. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b140-v14-10","title":"纖維與殘餘韌性：定量估算","titleEn":"Fibres and residual toughness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「纖維與殘餘韌性」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fibres and residual toughness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設中央單點載重的三點彎曲缺口梁，殘餘荷重12 kN、跨距0.5 m、寬0.15 m、有效韌帶0.125 m，fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume a notched beam under three-point centre loading with residual load 12 kN, span 0.5 m, width 0.15 m and ligament 0.125 m; fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設中央單點載重的三點彎曲缺口梁，殘餘荷重12 kN、跨距0.5 m、寬0.15 m、有效韌帶0.125 m，fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume a notched beam under three-point centre loading with residual load 12 kN, span 0.5 m, width 0.15 m and ligament 0.125 m; fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「纖維與殘餘韌性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fibres and residual toughness\", which statement holds?","options":["同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。"],"optionsEn":["Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b140-v14-11","title":"纖維與殘餘韌性：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Fibres and residual toughness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「纖維與殘餘韌性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fibres and residual toughness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄纖維與殘餘韌性的資料來源與適用條件。依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for fibres and residual toughness. Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity.","failure":"注意干擾：澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。","textEn":"Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄纖維與殘餘韌性的資料來源與適用條件。依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for fibres and residual toughness. Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「纖維與殘餘韌性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fibres and residual toughness\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。","依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review.","Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution."],"answer":2,"explanation":"依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b140-v14-12","title":"纖維與殘餘韌性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fibres and residual toughness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「纖維與殘餘韌性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fibres and residual toughness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。","textEn":"Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「纖維與殘餘韌性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fibres and residual toughness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。"],"optionsEn":["Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square."],"answer":0,"explanation":"澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b140-v14-13","title":"模具與幾何公差：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Moulds and geometric tolerances: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-12"],"objective":"說明「模具與幾何公差」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Moulds and geometric tolerances” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"環片尺寸決定成環形狀、接縫接觸與止水墊壓縮，累積偏差可能在最後一塊才暴露。模具磨耗及溫度使尺寸隨批次變化，應分辨單件誤差與系統性偏差，不能只檢查能否拼上。 假設一環6片各有同向弧長偏差0.5 mm，總偏差3 mm；獨立隨機誤差才可用平方根加總。 同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「模具與幾何公差」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Dimensions control ring shape, joint contact and gasket compression. Accumulated error may appear only at the final piece, while mould wear and temperature introduce batch drift. Distinguish individual and systematic error rather than accepting mere assembly fit. If an assumed ring has 6 segments each with a same-direction arc-length bias of 0.5 mm, total bias is 3 mm; root-sum-square applies only to independent random errors. Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Moulds and geometric tolerances” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「模具與幾何公差」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Moulds and geometric tolerances”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-13-k1","title":"模具與幾何公差","titleEn":"Moulds and geometric tolerances","text":"環片尺寸決定成環形狀、接縫接觸與止水墊壓縮，累積偏差可能在最後一塊才暴露。模具磨耗及溫度使尺寸隨批次變化，應分辨單件誤差與系統性偏差，不能只檢查能否拼上。","textEn":"Dimensions control ring shape, joint contact and gasket compression. Accumulated error may appear only at the final piece, while mould wear and temperature introduce batch drift.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「模具與幾何公差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Moulds and geometric tolerances\" is correct?","options":["同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。","環片尺寸決定成環形狀、接縫接觸與止水墊壓縮，累積偏差可能在最後一塊才暴露。","早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square.","Dimensions control ring shape, joint contact and gasket compression.","High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"環片尺寸決定成環形狀、接縫接觸與止水墊壓縮，累積偏差可能在最後一塊才暴露。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Dimensions control ring shape, joint contact and gasket compression. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b140-v14-14","title":"模具與幾何公差：定量估算","titleEn":"Moulds and geometric tolerances: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「模具與幾何公差」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Moulds and geometric tolerances” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設一環6片各有同向弧長偏差0.5 mm，總偏差3 mm；獨立隨機誤差才可用平方根加總。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. If an assumed ring has 6 segments each with a same-direction arc-length bias of 0.5 mm, total bias is 3 mm; root-sum-square applies only to independent random errors. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設一環6片各有同向弧長偏差0.5 mm，總偏差3 mm；獨立隨機誤差才可用平方根加總。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. If an assumed ring has 6 segments each with a same-direction arc-length bias of 0.5 mm, total bias is 3 mm; root-sum-square applies only to independent random errors.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「模具與幾何公差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Moulds and geometric tolerances\", which statement holds?","options":["千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。","完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting.","An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b140-v14-15","title":"模具與幾何公差：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Moulds and geometric tolerances: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「模具與幾何公差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Moulds and geometric tolerances” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄模具與幾何公差的資料來源與適用條件。以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for moulds and geometric tolerances. Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design.","failure":"注意干擾：同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。","textEn":"Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄模具與幾何公差的資料來源與適用條件。以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for moulds and geometric tolerances. Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「模具與幾何公差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Moulds and geometric tolerances\"?","options":["以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。"],"optionsEn":["Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b140-v14-16","title":"模具與幾何公差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Moulds and geometric tolerances: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「模具與幾何公差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Moulds and geometric tolerances” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。","textEn":"Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「模具與幾何公差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Moulds and geometric tolerances\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。","早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges.","High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b140-v14-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「早齡溫差與養護」與「吊運支點與裂縫」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Early-age temperature and curing\" and \"Handling supports and cracking\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b140-v14-17","title":"早齡溫差與養護：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Early-age temperature and curing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-16"],"objective":"說明「早齡溫差與養護」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Early-age temperature and curing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"水化升溫與外界冷卻形成溫度梯度，受約束收縮可在強度尚低時引起裂縫。高早強不代表低熱裂風險，需同時看溫度歷程、拘束和濕度，避免把養護只等同抗壓數字。 假設α=10⁻⁵/K、E=20 GPa、全約束降溫20 K，彈性拉應力EαΔT=4 MPa；實際徐變會改變結果。 快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「早齡溫差與養護」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydration and cooling create gradients whose restrained contraction can crack young concrete. High early strength does not eliminate thermal risk; temperature history, restraint and moisture must be reviewed alongside compressive results. Assume α=10⁻⁵/K, E=20 GPa and fully restrained cooling of 20 K; elastic tensile stress EαΔT=4 MPa, modified in reality by creep. Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Early-age temperature and curing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「早齡溫差與養護」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Early-age temperature and curing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-17-k1","title":"早齡溫差與養護","titleEn":"Early-age temperature and curing","text":"水化升溫與外界冷卻形成溫度梯度，受約束收縮可在強度尚低時引起裂縫。高早強不代表低熱裂風險，需同時看溫度歷程、拘束和濕度，避免把養護只等同抗壓數字。","textEn":"Hydration and cooling create gradients whose restrained contraction can crack young concrete. High early strength does not eliminate thermal risk; temperature history, restraint and moisture must be reviewed alongside compressive results.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「早齡溫差與養護」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Early-age temperature and curing\" is correct?","options":["早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。","同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","水化升溫與外界冷卻形成溫度梯度，受約束收縮可在強度尚低時引起裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking.","Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","Hydration and cooling create gradients whose restrained contraction can crack young concrete."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水化升溫與外界冷卻形成溫度梯度，受約束收縮可在強度尚低時引起裂縫。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydration and cooling create gradients whose restrained contraction can crack young concrete. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b140-v14-18","title":"早齡溫差與養護：定量估算","titleEn":"Early-age temperature and curing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「早齡溫差與養護」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Early-age temperature and curing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設α=10⁻⁵/K、E=20 GPa、全約束降溫20 K，彈性拉應力EαΔT=4 MPa；實際徐變會改變結果。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume α=10⁻⁵/K, E=20 GPa and fully restrained cooling of 20 K; elastic tensile stress EαΔT=4 MPa, modified in reality by creep. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設α=10⁻⁵/K、E=20 GPa、全約束降溫20 K，彈性拉應力EαΔT=4 MPa；實際徐變會改變結果。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume α=10⁻⁵/K, E=20 GPa and fully restrained cooling of 20 K; elastic tensile stress EαΔT=4 MPa, modified in reality by creep.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「早齡溫差與養護」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Early-age temperature and curing\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。","掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness.","A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b140-v14-19","title":"早齡溫差與養護：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Early-age temperature and curing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「早齡溫差與養護」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Early-age temperature and curing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄早齡溫差與養護的資料來源與適用條件。記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for early-age temperature and curing. Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction.","failure":"注意干擾：快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。","textEn":"Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄早齡溫差與養護的資料來源與適用條件。記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for early-age temperature and curing. Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「早齡溫差與養護」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Early-age temperature and curing\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。","少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns.","The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch."],"answer":1,"explanation":"記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b140-v14-20","title":"早齡溫差與養護：失效診斷","titleEn":"Early-age temperature and curing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「早齡溫差與養護」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Early-age temperature and curing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。","textEn":"Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「早齡溫差與養護」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Early-age temperature and curing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b140-v14-21","title":"吊運支點與裂縫：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Handling supports and cracking: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-20"],"objective":"說明「吊運支點與裂縫」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Handling supports and cracking” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"吊運和堆放的支點控制環片暫態彎矩，位置偏差可比重量誤差更敏感。吊點、墊木和構件方向需要由核准方案決定，教學力學只解釋為何同一環片在不同支承下會有不同應力。 假設簡支示意梁總均布載重20 kN、跨2 m，Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m；曲面環片需專門分析。 墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「吊運支點與裂縫」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Handling and storage supports control transient bending, sometimes more sensitively than weight error. Approved plans govern lifting points, dunnage and orientation; mechanics explains why the same segment develops different stresses under different support arrangements. For an assumed simply supported illustrative beam with total distributed load 20 kN over 2 m, Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m; curved segments require specific analysis. Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Handling supports and cracking” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「吊運支點與裂縫」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Handling supports and cracking”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-21-k1","title":"吊運支點與裂縫","titleEn":"Handling supports and cracking","text":"吊運和堆放的支點控制環片暫態彎矩，位置偏差可比重量誤差更敏感。吊點、墊木和構件方向需要由核准方案決定，教學力學只解釋為何同一環片在不同支承下會有不同應力。","textEn":"Handling and storage supports control transient bending, sometimes more sensitively than weight error. Approved plans govern lifting points, dunnage and orientation; mechanics explains why the same segment develops different stresses under different support arrangements.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「吊運支點與裂縫」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Handling supports and cracking\" is correct?","options":["吊運和堆放的支點控制環片暫態彎矩，位置偏差可比重量誤差更敏感。","同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Handling and storage supports control transient bending, sometimes more sensitively than weight error.","Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting."],"answer":0,"explanation":"吊運和堆放的支點控制環片暫態彎矩，位置偏差可比重量誤差更敏感。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Handling and storage supports control transient bending, sometimes more sensitively than weight error. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b140-v14-22","title":"吊運支點與裂縫：定量估算","titleEn":"Handling supports and cracking: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「吊運支點與裂縫」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Handling supports and cracking” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設簡支示意梁總均布載重20 kN、跨2 m，Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m；曲面環片需專門分析。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. For an assumed simply supported illustrative beam with total distributed load 20 kN over 2 m, Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m; curved segments require specific analysis. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設簡支示意梁總均布載重20 kN、跨2 m，Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m；曲面環片需專門分析。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. For an assumed simply supported illustrative beam with total distributed load 20 kN over 2 m, Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m; curved segments require specific analysis.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「吊運支點與裂縫」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Handling supports and cracking\", which statement holds?","options":["完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。"],"optionsEn":["An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b140-v14-23","title":"吊運支點與裂縫：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Handling supports and cracking: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「吊運支點與裂縫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Handling supports and cracking” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄吊運支點與裂縫的資料來源與適用條件。核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for handling supports and cracking. Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction.","failure":"注意干擾：墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。","textEn":"Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄吊運支點與裂縫的資料來源與適用條件。核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for handling supports and cracking. Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「吊運支點與裂縫」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Handling supports and cracking\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。","核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.","Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial."],"answer":2,"explanation":"核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b140-v14-24","title":"吊運支點與裂縫：失效診斷","titleEn":"Handling supports and cracking: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「吊運支點與裂縫」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Handling supports and cracking” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。","textEn":"Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「吊運支點與裂縫」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Handling supports and cracking\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting."],"answer":0,"explanation":"墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b140-v14-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「推進千斤頂局部承壓」與「防火與爆裂驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Local jack bearing\" and \"Fire and spalling verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b140-v14-25","title":"推進千斤頂局部承壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Local jack bearing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-24"],"objective":"說明「推進千斤頂局部承壓」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Local jack bearing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"推進反力透過千斤頂墊板進入環片，局部承壓與劈裂不等同全環均勻軸力。墊板位置、接觸面和平整度決定擴散路徑，偏載可能讓邊緣先損壞而平均壓力仍合理。 假設墊板力1 MN、面積0.1 m²，平均承壓10 MPa；不能代替局部劈裂與邊距檢核。 墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「推進千斤頂局部承壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Thrust enters through jack pads, creating local bearing and splitting unlike uniform ring compression. Pad location, contact and flatness govern spreading, and eccentricity can damage an edge despite an acceptable mean pressure. An assumed pad force 1 MN over 0.1 m² gives mean bearing 10 MPa; splitting and edge-distance checks remain separate. Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Local jack bearing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「推進千斤頂局部承壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Local jack bearing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-25-k1","title":"推進千斤頂局部承壓","titleEn":"Local jack bearing","text":"推進反力透過千斤頂墊板進入環片，局部承壓與劈裂不等同全環均勻軸力。墊板位置、接觸面和平整度決定擴散路徑，偏載可能讓邊緣先損壞而平均壓力仍合理。","textEn":"Thrust enters through jack pads, creating local bearing and splitting unlike uniform ring compression. Pad location, contact and flatness govern spreading, and eccentricity can damage an edge despite an acceptable mean pressure.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「推進千斤頂局部承壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Local jack bearing\" is correct?","options":["千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。","推進反力透過千斤頂墊板進入環片，局部承壓與劈裂不等同全環均勻軸力。","熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。"],"optionsEn":["Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting.","Thrust enters through jack pads, creating local bearing and splitting unlike uniform ring compression.","Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness."],"answer":1,"explanation":"推進反力透過千斤頂墊板進入環片，局部承壓與劈裂不等同全環均勻軸力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Thrust enters through jack pads, creating local bearing and splitting unlike uniform ring compression. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b140-v14-26","title":"推進千斤頂局部承壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Local jack bearing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「推進千斤頂局部承壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Local jack bearing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設墊板力1 MN、面積0.1 m²，平均承壓10 MPa；不能代替局部劈裂與邊距檢核。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. An assumed pad force 1 MN over 0.1 m² gives mean bearing 10 MPa; splitting and edge-distance checks remain separate. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設墊板力1 MN、面積0.1 m²，平均承壓10 MPa；不能代替局部劈裂與邊距檢核。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. An assumed pad force 1 MN over 0.1 m² gives mean bearing 10 MPa; splitting and edge-distance checks remain separate.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「推進千斤頂局部承壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Local jack bearing\", which statement holds?","options":["掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。","少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review.","The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b140-v14-27","title":"推進千斤頂局部承壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Local jack bearing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「推進千斤頂局部承壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local jack bearing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄推進千斤頂局部承壓的資料來源與適用條件。把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for local jack bearing. Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust.","failure":"注意干擾：墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。","textEn":"Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄推進千斤頂局部承壓的資料來源與適用條件。把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for local jack bearing. Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「推進千斤頂局部承壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Local jack bearing\"?","options":["把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。"],"optionsEn":["Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b140-v14-28","title":"推進千斤頂局部承壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Local jack bearing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「推進千斤頂局部承壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local jack bearing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。","textEn":"Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「推進千斤頂局部承壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Local jack bearing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。","熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable.","Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness."],"answer":1,"explanation":"墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b140-v14-29","title":"防火與爆裂驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Fire and spalling verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-28"],"objective":"說明「防火與爆裂驗證」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fire and spalling verification” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"火災熱傳、孔壓與材料退化會共同影響環片，表面爆裂使有效厚度減少並暴露配筋。材料小試與足尺受載試驗回答不同問題，防火策略需依隧道用途和設計火災情境評估。 假設熱擴散率a=10⁻⁶ m²/s、時間3600 s，尺度√(at)=0.06 m；不等於爆裂深度或耐火厚度。 把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「防火與爆裂驗證」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fire combines heat transfer, pore pressure and material degradation. Spalling reduces effective thickness and exposes reinforcement. Small material tests and loaded full-scale tests answer different questions, requiring a scenario appropriate to tunnel use. Assume thermal diffusivity a=10⁻⁶ m²/s over 3600 s; √(at)=0.06 m is a diffusion scale, not spalling depth or required fire thickness. An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Fire and spalling verification” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「防火與爆裂驗證」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Fire and spalling verification”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-29-k1","title":"防火與爆裂驗證","titleEn":"Fire and spalling verification","text":"火災熱傳、孔壓與材料退化會共同影響環片，表面爆裂使有效厚度減少並暴露配筋。材料小試與足尺受載試驗回答不同問題，防火策略需依隧道用途和設計火災情境評估。","textEn":"Fire combines heat transfer, pore pressure and material degradation. Spalling reduces effective thickness and exposes reinforcement.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「防火與爆裂驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fire and spalling verification\" is correct?","options":["熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。","完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。","火災熱傳、孔壓與材料退化會共同影響環片，表面爆裂使有效厚度減少並暴露配筋。"],"optionsEn":["Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness.","An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.","Fire combines heat transfer, pore pressure and material degradation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"火災熱傳、孔壓與材料退化會共同影響環片，表面爆裂使有效厚度減少並暴露配筋。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fire combines heat transfer, pore pressure and material degradation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b140-v14-30","title":"防火與爆裂驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Fire and spalling verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「防火與爆裂驗證」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fire and spalling verification” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設熱擴散率a=10⁻⁶ m²/s、時間3600 s，尺度√(at)=0.06 m；不等於爆裂深度或耐火厚度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume thermal diffusivity a=10⁻⁶ m²/s over 3600 s; √(at)=0.06 m is a diffusion scale, not spalling depth or required fire thickness. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設熱擴散率a=10⁻⁶ m²/s、時間3600 s，尺度√(at)=0.06 m；不等於爆裂深度或耐火厚度。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume thermal diffusivity a=10⁻⁶ m²/s over 3600 s; √(at)=0.06 m is a diffusion scale, not spalling depth or required fire thickness.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「防火與爆裂驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fire and spalling verification\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。","纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance.","Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b140-v14-31","title":"防火與爆裂驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Fire and spalling verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「防火與爆裂驗證」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fire and spalling verification” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄防火與爆裂驗證的資料來源與適用條件。核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for fire and spalling verification. Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification.","failure":"注意干擾：把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。","textEn":"Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄防火與爆裂驗證的資料來源與適用條件。核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for fire and spalling verification. Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「防火與爆裂驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fire and spalling verification\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。","早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity.","High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b140-v14-32","title":"防火與爆裂驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fire and spalling verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「防火與爆裂驗證」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fire and spalling verification” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「熱擴散尺度就是實際爆裂深度和必需耐火厚度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Thermal diffusion scale equals actual spalling depth and required fire-protection thickness.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。","textEn":"An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「防火與爆裂驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fire and spalling verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。","把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.","An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b140-v14-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「耐久擴散與保護層」與「環片序號與品質交接」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Durability diffusion and cover\" and \"Segment serials and quality handover\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b140-v14-33","title":"耐久擴散與保護層：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Durability diffusion and cover: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-32"],"objective":"說明「耐久擴散與保護層」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Durability diffusion and cover” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"離子與水分進入混凝土的速度受孔隙結構、裂縫和接縫影響，完好材料的擴散模型不能涵蓋所有快速通道。保護層需兼顧製造公差與裂縫控制，不能只依名義厚度預測壽命。 假設純擴散尺度t≈x²/D，x由40增50 mm，其餘相同，時間比(50/40)²=1.5625；非壽命保證。 局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「耐久擴散與保護層」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Moisture and ions enter through matrix pores, cracks and joints. Intact-material diffusion misses preferential paths, so cover must consider manufacturing tolerance and cracking rather than predicting life from nominal thickness alone. Under assumed diffusion scaling t≈x²/D, increasing x from 40 to 50 mm gives time ratio 1.5625 at unchanged D, not a service-life guarantee. Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Durability diffusion and cover” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「耐久擴散與保護層」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Durability diffusion and cover”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-33-k1","title":"耐久擴散與保護層","titleEn":"Durability diffusion and cover","text":"離子與水分進入混凝土的速度受孔隙結構、裂縫和接縫影響，完好材料的擴散模型不能涵蓋所有快速通道。保護層需兼顧製造公差與裂縫控制，不能只依名義厚度預測壽命。","textEn":"Moisture and ions enter through matrix pores, cracks and joints. Intact-material diffusion misses preferential paths, so cover must consider manufacturing tolerance and cracking rather than predicting life from nominal thickness alone.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「耐久擴散與保護層」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Durability diffusion and cover\" is correct?","options":["離子與水分進入混凝土的速度受孔隙結構、裂縫和接縫影響，完好材料的擴散模型不能涵蓋所有快速通道。","完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。","掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。"],"optionsEn":["Moisture and ions enter through matrix pores, cracks and joints.","An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.","A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review."],"answer":0,"explanation":"離子與水分進入混凝土的速度受孔隙結構、裂縫和接縫影響，完好材料的擴散模型不能涵蓋所有快速通道。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Moisture and ions enter through matrix pores, cracks and joints. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b140-v14-34","title":"耐久擴散與保護層：定量估算","titleEn":"Durability diffusion and cover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「耐久擴散與保護層」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Durability diffusion and cover” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設純擴散尺度t≈x²/D，x由40增50 mm，其餘相同，時間比(50/40)²=1.5625；非壽命保證。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Under assumed diffusion scaling t≈x²/D, increasing x from 40 to 50 mm gives time ratio 1.5625 at unchanged D, not a service-life guarantee. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設純擴散尺度t≈x²/D，x由40增50 mm，其餘相同，時間比(50/40)²=1.5625；非壽命保證。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Under assumed diffusion scaling t≈x²/D, increasing x from 40 to 50 mm gives time ratio 1.5625 at unchanged D, not a service-life guarantee.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「耐久擴散與保護層」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Durability diffusion and cover\", which statement holds?","options":["少量試塊平均強度就是整批環片的特徵設計強度。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","同向尺寸偏差可以和獨立隨機誤差一樣平方根加總。"],"optionsEn":["The mean of a few specimens is the characteristic design strength of the whole batch.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Same-direction dimensional biases can be combined like independent random errors by root-sum-square."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b140-v14-35","title":"耐久擴散與保護層：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Durability diffusion and cover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「耐久擴散與保護層」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Durability diffusion and cover” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄耐久擴散與保護層的資料來源與適用條件。量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for durability diffusion and cover. Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions.","failure":"注意干擾：局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。","textEn":"Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄耐久擴散與保護層的資料來源與適用條件。量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for durability diffusion and cover. Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「耐久擴散與保護層」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Durability diffusion and cover\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","同一環片的吊運支點移動不會改變暫態彎矩。","量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Moving handling support points cannot change transient bending in the same segment.","Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b140-v14-36","title":"耐久擴散與保護層：失效診斷","titleEn":"Durability diffusion and cover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「耐久擴散與保護層」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Durability diffusion and cover” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「完好混凝土擴散係數可以完整代表貫穿裂縫的傳輸。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An intact-concrete diffusion coefficient fully represents transport through a through-crack.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。","textEn":"Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「耐久擴散與保護層」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Durability diffusion and cover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。"],"optionsEn":["Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review."],"answer":0,"explanation":"局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b140-v14-37","title":"環片序號與品質交接：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Segment serials and quality handover: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-36"],"objective":"說明「環片序號與品質交接」如何影響隧道管片預鑄與養護的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Segment serials and quality handover” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Tunnel-segment precasting and curing”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"環片從模具、材料批次到組裝位置形成長資料鏈，任何環節失去身份都會削弱缺陷追蹤。交接應讓一個裂縫回到製造和運輸事件，也讓異常批次找到所有已安裝位置。 假設一批120片有118片可完整追溯，比例98.33%；缺失2片不能因整體比例高而自動驗收。 重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「環片序號與品質交接」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Segments form a data chain from mould and batch to installed position. Lost identity impairs defect tracing; handover must connect a crack to manufacturing and handling events and locate every installed piece from an affected batch. If 118 of an assumed 120 segments are fully traceable, the rate is 98.33%; the remaining 2 do not qualify automatically because the overall rate is high. Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Segment serials and quality handover” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「環片序號與品質交接」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Segment serials and quality handover”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-37-k1","title":"環片序號與品質交接","titleEn":"Segment serials and quality handover","text":"環片從模具、材料批次到組裝位置形成長資料鏈，任何環節失去身份都會削弱缺陷追蹤。交接應讓一個裂縫回到製造和運輸事件，也讓異常批次找到所有已安裝位置。","textEn":"Segments form a data chain from mould and batch to installed position. Lost identity impairs defect tracing; handover must connect a crack to manufacturing and handling events and locate every installed piece from an affected batch.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「環片序號與品質交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Segment serials and quality handover\" is correct?","options":["掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。","環片從模具、材料批次到組裝位置形成長資料鏈，任何環節失去身份都會削弱缺陷追蹤。","永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。"],"optionsEn":["A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review.","Segments form a data chain from mould and batch to installed position.","Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"環片從模具、材料批次到組裝位置形成長資料鏈，任何環節失去身份都會削弱缺陷追蹤。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Segments form a data chain from mould and batch to installed position. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b140-v14-38","title":"環片序號與品質交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Segment serials and quality handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「環片序號與品質交接」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Segment serials and quality handover” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設一批120片有118片可完整追溯，比例98.33%；缺失2片不能因整體比例高而自動驗收。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. If 118 of an assumed 120 segments are fully traceable, the rate is 98.33%; the remaining 2 do not qualify automatically because the overall rate is high. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設一批120片有118片可完整追溯，比例98.33%；缺失2片不能因整體比例高而自動驗收。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. If 118 of an assumed 120 segments are fully traceable, the rate is 98.33%; the remaining 2 do not qualify automatically because the overall rate is high.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「環片序號與品質交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Segment serials and quality handover\", which statement holds?","options":["纖維添加重量相同就一定產生相同方向的殘餘拉力。","早齡抗壓強度高就代表不會發生溫差收縮裂縫。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Equal fibre dosage necessarily produces equal residual tensile resistance in every direction.","High early compressive strength guarantees absence of thermal shrinkage cracking.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b140-v14-39","title":"環片序號與品質交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Segment serials and quality handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「環片序號與品質交接」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Segment serials and quality handover” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄環片序號與品質交接的資料來源與適用條件。抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for segment serials and quality handover. Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content.","failure":"注意干擾：重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。","textEn":"Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄環片序號與品質交接的資料來源與適用條件。抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for segment serials and quality handover. Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「環片序號與品質交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Segment serials and quality handover\"?","options":["抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","千斤頂總推力除總接觸面積足以排除所有局部劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Total jack force divided by total contact area excludes all local splitting."],"answer":0,"explanation":"抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b140-v14-40","title":"環片序號與品質交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Segment serials and quality handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b140-v14-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「環片序號與品質交接」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Segment serials and quality handover” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「掃碼成功就代表環片資料內容已完成工程品質審查。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A successful barcode scan means the segment records have passed engineering quality review.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b140-v14-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。","textEn":"Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b140-v14-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「環片序號與品質交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Segment serials and quality handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。","永久成環荷載合格就代表運輸和吊運階段必定合格。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness.","Adequate permanent-ring capacity necessarily proves adequate transport and handling performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v14s-hs2-segments","v14s-crossrail-fire","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"curriculumVersion":14,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
